    {
      "content": "<div style=\"font-family: 'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif; line-height:1.6;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:stretch; flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n    <div style=\"flex:1; min-width:280px; padding:14px 16px; border-radius:14px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff1f5,#fffdf2); border:1px solid rgba(255,120,160,.25); box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(255,120,160,.10);\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:18px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.5px;\">\n        蟠桃为什么扁扁的？[[sticker:doro/疑惑]]\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px; color:#333;\">\n        主要原因不是“被压扁”哦，而是<strong>品种的遗传特性</strong>：蟠桃（也叫“扁桃 / 甜甜圈桃”）在果实发育时，沿着<strong>果柄→果顶</strong>这条“纵向”增长被天然限制，所以看起来像小圆饼一样扁。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"flex:1; min-width:280px; padding:14px 16px; border-radius:14px; background:#f6fbff; border:1px solid rgba(80,140,255,.25); box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(80,140,255,.10);\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#1f4b99;\">一句话版结论</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px; color:#233;\">\n        <strong>基因决定的“发育方向差异”</strong>：横向（直径）正常长，纵向（高度）长得少 → 就扁了。[[sticker:doro/看着你]]\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-top:14px; padding:14px 16px; border-radius:14px; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#fff7fb); border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:800; font-size:16px;\">更具体一点：它“扁”的生物学原因</div>\n    <ul style=\"margin:10px 0 0 18px; color:#333;\">\n      <li><strong>遗传控制</strong>：蟠桃的扁形状通常由特定基因/位点控制（研究里常提到与果形相关的调控基因，比如 <em>OVATE family</em> 相关候选基因）。这是育种选出来的稳定性状。</li>\n      <li><strong>生长轴不一样</strong>：果实发育时，细胞分裂/膨大在不同方向分配不同——“高”长得少，“宽”长得多。</li>\n      <li><strong>不是外力压的</strong>：不是套袋、挤压、夹板造成的（那种外力通常会留下不均匀畸形、疤痕或裂果痕）。</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-top:14px; display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n    <div style=\"flex:1; min-width:280px; padding:14px 16px; border-radius:14px; background:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:800;\">小示意图（生长方向）[[sticker:doro/快]]</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n        <svg width=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 170\" style=\"max-height:170px;\">\n          <defs>\n            <linearGradient id=\"g1\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"1\">\n              <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#ffb3c7\"/>\n              <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#ffd6a5\"/>\n            </linearGradient>\n          </defs>\n\n          <!-- round peach -->\n          <circle cx=\"135\" cy=\"85\" r=\"55\" fill=\"url(#g1)\" opacity=\"0.95\" stroke=\"#d85b7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n          <text x=\"135\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#333\">普通桃：纵向≈横向</text>\n\n          <!-- flat peach -->\n          <ellipse cx=\"385\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"38\" fill=\"url(#g1)\" opacity=\"0.95\" stroke=\"#d85b7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n          <text x=\"385\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#333\">蟠桃：纵向变短</text>\n\n          <!-- arrows -->\n          <line x1=\"135\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"135\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#2b6cb0\" stroke-width=\"3\" />\n          <polygon points=\"135,22 128,34 142,34\" fill=\"#2b6cb0\"/>\n          <polygon points=\"135,148 128,136 142,136\" fill=\"#2b6cb0\"/>\n          <text x=\"150\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2b6cb0\">纵向生长</text>\n\n          <line x1=\"315\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"455\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"#2b6cb0\" stroke-width=\"3\" />\n          <polygon points=\"307,85 319,78 319,92\" fill=\"#2b6cb0\"/>\n          <polygon points=\"463,85 451,78 451,92\" fill=\"#2b6cb0\"/>\n          <text x=\"365\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2b6cb0\">横向生长</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"flex:1; min-width:280px; padding:14px 16px; border-radius:14px; background:#f7fff8; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:800;\">顺便：为什么大家喜欢蟠桃？[[sticker:doro/开心]]</div>\n      <ul style=\"margin:10px 0 0 18px; color:#333;\">\n        <li>核小、可食率高（不少品种吃起来更“划算”）。</li>\n        <li>果肉更紧实或更脆甜（看具体品种）。</li>\n        <li>外形可爱、好拿好啃。</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-top:14px; padding:12px 16px; border-radius:14px; background:#0b1220; color:#dbe7ff; border:1px solid rgba(120,160,255,.25);\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:800;\">把子肉小贴士</div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:6px;\">\n      如果你买到的“扁桃”出现<strong>明显裂口、局部塌陷、长相不对称</strong>，那可能是授粉/温度/病虫或运输挤压导致的畸形；而正常蟠桃是<strong>整体均匀的扁圆形</strong>。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-top:10px; color:#444;\">\n    你想问的是“神话里的蟠桃”还是“水果摊上的蟠桃（扁桃）”呀？我可以按你说的那个版本再展开讲讲～[[sticker:doro/看着你]]\n  </div>\n</div>",
